---
alwaysApply: true
---
When generating code:
1. Always use AppTheme constants (Colors, Typography, Spacing)
2. Always implement [weak self] in async closures
3. Always add accessibility labels
4. Always support dark mode
5. Always use LazyVStack for lists (10+ items)
6. Always pre-compute expensive values
7. Always include SwiftUI #Preview
8. Always use @MainActor for ObservableObject
9. Always implement proper deinit cleanup
10. Always follow MVVM architecture

## 🖼️ IMAGE URL RULES (CRITICAL!)
11. NEVER use wikipedia.org or wikimedia.org URLs for images (they get blocked)
12. NEVER use .svg files (AsyncImage can't render them)
13. ALWAYS use YouTube thumbnails (ytimg.com) or approved CDNs for logos
14. ALWAYS include previewFallbackURL for LiveTVChannel (use Apple test stream)
15. Approved CDNs: ytimg.com, imgur.com, cloudinary.com, googleusercontent.com, akamaized.net, cloudfront.net